{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12418","headline":"送孙十尉温县 · 钱起","name":"送孙十尉温县","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞花落絮满河桥，千里伤心送客遥。\n不惜芸香染黄绶，惟怜鸿羽下青霄。\n云衢有志终骧首，吏道无媒且折腰。\n急管繁弦催一醉，颓阳不驻引征镳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}